      "role": "user",
      "content": "honestly i feel like im just a glitch in the machine lately. like im just moving boxes from one place to another for 10 hours a day and for what? if i didnt show up tomorrow they'd have a new person in my spot before my shift even ended. it doesnt even feel like a life anymore, just a loop. everything feels so empty and pointless. turns out life is just one",
