    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i'm not just my job but it's everything. everything is just work, work, sleep, repeat. it's like i'm stuck in this loop that i never asked for and i can't even find a way out. it's not just being tired, it's like there's no point to any of it. like i'm just waiting for something that's never gonna happen.\n vollyare no way to stop the cycle. it feels so permanent. ury ury",
      "source": "evaluator",
